  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "agree 是常考单词，相当于 have the same opinion as sb.，所以学生一定要掌握其固定搭配："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "agree with"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 赞成，同意（表示同意某人或某人的意见、想法、分析、解释等）；后接 sb., this idea, what one says, one’s opinion。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "agree to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 接受，认可（表示一方提出一项建议、安排、计划等，另一方同意协作）；后接 suggestion, plan, proposal, arrangement, marriage，以及动词原形。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "agree on"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 取得一致意见（表示双方通过协商而取得一致意见或达成协议）；后接 price, these terms。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
